{
  "about": "The assistant benchmark. Each scenario is a request a user actually made (the issue it came from is named), the answers a user would give to the questions the assistant is expected to ask, and checks the finished part must pass. The checks are geometry the app measures, never the model's own account. `replay` is a known-good reply sequence for the offline mode, written in the current protocol: it proves the harness and the ops, not any model. `refSeconds` is the time a skilled person needs in Fusion 360 / Inventor for the same part: the operations a pro would use, ~8 s each. `set` is `main` (tuned on) or `holdout` (never tuned on). `creative` scenarios are run three times and must come out as visibly different designs.",
